(1355, 1, '2025-06-24 23:55:30', '2025-06-24 23:55:30', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"neve-fse\",\"tagName\":\"header\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"},\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/themes/neve-fse/assets/img/neve-fse-img12.jpg\",\"dimRatio\":0,\"overlayColor\":\"ti-bg-inv\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":true,\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"minHeight\":344,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"contentPosition\":\"center center\",\"isDark\":false,\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1140px\",\"wideSize\":\"740px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull is-light\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:24px;min-height:344px\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/themes/neve-fse/assets/img/neve-fse-img12.jpg\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" data-object-position=\"50% 50%\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-ti-bg-inv-background-color has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"4rem\",\"bottom\":\"4rem\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-align-center\" style=\"margin-top:4rem;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4rem;margin-left:0\">Taller de Parkinson</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[metaslider id=\"95\"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"},\"blockGap\":\"64px\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>En ocasiones las personas con Enfermedad de Parkinson (EP) salen espontáneamente de la situación de inhibición motora en que se encuentran y esto es lo que conocemos como fenómeno paradojal. Y allí donde el movimiento era impensado, se suelta de sus ataduras como la mariposa de su capullo, transformándose y señalando un camino.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"},\"blockGap\":\"40px\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1308,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/historia.avif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1308\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"32px\",\"right\":\"32px\",\"bottom\":\"32px\",\"left\":\"32px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"0px\",\"topRight\":\"0px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"5px\",\"bottomRight\":\"5px\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:5px;border-bottom-right-radius:5px;background-color:#bed8fa2e;padding-top:32px;padding-right:32px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:32px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">Historia</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Nuestro Taller de Parkinson (TdP) fue creado en año 2002 como un espacio para propiciar transformaciones como la de la mariposa que, de oruga, pasa a ser una mariposa que sale de su capullo y vuela libremente en la naturaleza, su entorno de vida. &nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/historia/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1309,\"aspectRatio\":\"3/2\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border is-style-default\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/CC-Malvinas-Mes-concientizacion-Parkinson-2024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1309\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"32px\",\"right\":\"32px\",\"bottom\":\"32px\",\"left\":\"32px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"0px\",\"topRight\":\"0px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"5px\",\"bottomRight\":\"5px\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:5px;border-bottom-right-radius:5px;background-color:#bed8fa2e;padding-top:32px;padding-right:32px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:32px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">¿Quiénes somos?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">El Taller de Parkinson reúne a un grupo de voluntarios profesionales, estudiantes, personas con Parkinson y familiares con un mismo objetivo: mejorar la calidad de vida de las personas con EP y su entorno a través de acciones a un cambio conceptual y actitudinal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/quienes-somos/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1312,\"aspectRatio\":\"3/2\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border is-style-default\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/pppp.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1312\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"32px\",\"right\":\"32px\",\"bottom\":\"32px\",\"left\":\"32px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"5px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-radius:5px;background-color:#bed8fa2e;padding-top:32px;padding-right:32px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:32px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">¿Qué hacemos?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">El tratamiento de la persona con Enfermedad de Parkinson requiere necesariamente de una perspectiva integral donde la familia o cuidadores estén involucrados. Para ello, se realiza una seria de actividades, en el que se explaya con más detalle.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/que-hacemos/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#bed8fa2e;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:64px;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:64px;padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"320px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Alexandre_Achille_Souques.jpg/320px-Alexandre_Achille_Souques.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"border-radius:4px;width:320px;height:auto\" title=\"\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alexandre_Achille_Souques.jpg\">See page for author</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0\">CC BY 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">La Kinesia Paradojal</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Achile Alexandre Souqués, uno de los más afamados neurólogos franceses de principios del siglo veinte, describió una propiedad en el movimiento de las personas con EP a la que llamó kinesia paradojal (<em>kinesie paradoxale</em>). Por medio de esta propiedad los pacientes que él observaba súbitamente podían comenzar a moverse, incluso correr, aun presentando alteraciones severas para caminar. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/la-kinesia-paradojal/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer Más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">El Taller y la Comunidad</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Extensión Universitaria. Proyecto aprobado por la Universidad Nacional de La Plata (UNLP) para desarrollar en 2008.<br>Título: Calidad de Vida en el Taller de Parkinson. Una estrategia innovadora de establecimiento de relaciones productivas entre Universidad y Comunidad.<br>A fines del año 2007 la UNLP decidió aprobar y subsidiar nuestro proyecto presentado en el marco de la Convocatoria a Proyectos de Extensión Universitaria de esa institución. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/el-taller-y-la-comunidad/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer Más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1313,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/WhatsApp-Image-2022-10-15-at-20.04.45-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1313\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|ti-fg-alt\"}}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-inv\",\"textColor\":\"ti-fg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-fg-alt-color has-ti-bg-inv-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1314,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/facultad-medicina-1jpg.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1314\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">El Taller y la Universidad</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Desde 2016 incluimos a nuestro Programa estable como parte de extensión optativa de la Práctica Final Obligatoria (PFO) de los alumnos de la Carrera de Ciencias Médicas (FCM, UNLP).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Programa estable de la Facultad de Ciencias Médicas de la UNLP. Aprobado por Expte. Nº 800-15709/13 del 05/08/13 de la FCM UNLP.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/el-taller-y-la-universidad/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"},\"blockGap\":\"40px\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"5px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-radius:5px\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":728,\"width\":\"583px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/CC-Malvinas-Mes-concientizacion-Parkinson-2024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-728\" style=\"border-radius:4px;width:583px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"neve-fse\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Página de inicio', 'Muestra la página de inicio de tu sitio, tanto si está configurada para mostrar las últimas entradas como si es una página estática. La plantilla de la página de inicio tiene prioridad sobre todas las plantillas.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '15-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-06-24 23:55:30', '2025-06-24 23:55:30', '', 15, 'https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/?p=1355', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(1356, 1, '2025-06-25 00:00:02', '2025-06-25 00:00:02', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"neve-fse\",\"tagName\":\"header\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"},\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/themes/neve-fse/assets/img/neve-fse-img12.jpg\",\"dimRatio\":0,\"overlayColor\":\"ti-bg-inv\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":true,\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"minHeight\":344,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"contentPosition\":\"center center\",\"isDark\":false,\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1140px\",\"wideSize\":\"740px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull is-light\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:24px;min-height:344px\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/themes/neve-fse/assets/img/neve-fse-img12.jpg\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" data-object-position=\"50% 50%\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-ti-bg-inv-background-color has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"4rem\",\"bottom\":\"4rem\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-align-center\" style=\"margin-top:4rem;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4rem;margin-left:0\">Taller de Parkinson</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[metaslider id=\"95\"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"},\"blockGap\":\"64px\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>En ocasiones las personas con Enfermedad de Parkinson (EP) salen espontáneamente de la situación de inhibición motora en que se encuentran y esto es lo que conocemos como fenómeno paradojal. Y allí donde el movimiento era impensado, se suelta de sus ataduras como la mariposa de su capullo, transformándose y señalando un camino.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"},\"blockGap\":\"40px\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1308,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/historia.avif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1308\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"32px\",\"right\":\"32px\",\"bottom\":\"32px\",\"left\":\"32px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"0px\",\"topRight\":\"0px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"5px\",\"bottomRight\":\"5px\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:5px;border-bottom-right-radius:5px;background-color:#bed8fa2e;padding-top:32px;padding-right:32px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:32px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">Historia</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Nuestro Taller de Parkinson (TdP) fue creado en año 2002 como un espacio para propiciar transformaciones como la de la mariposa que, de oruga, pasa a ser una mariposa que sale de su capullo y vuela libremente en la naturaleza, su entorno de vida. &nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/historia/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1309,\"aspectRatio\":\"3/2\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border is-style-default\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/CC-Malvinas-Mes-concientizacion-Parkinson-2024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1309\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"32px\",\"right\":\"32px\",\"bottom\":\"32px\",\"left\":\"32px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"0px\",\"topRight\":\"0px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"5px\",\"bottomRight\":\"5px\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:5px;border-bottom-right-radius:5px;background-color:#bed8fa2e;padding-top:32px;padding-right:32px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:32px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">¿Quiénes somos?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">El Taller de Parkinson reúne a un grupo de voluntarios profesionales, estudiantes, personas con Parkinson y familiares con un mismo objetivo: mejorar la calidad de vida de las personas con EP y su entorno a través de acciones a un cambio conceptual y actitudinal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/quienes-somos/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1312,\"aspectRatio\":\"3/2\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border is-style-default\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/pppp.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1312\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"32px\",\"right\":\"32px\",\"bottom\":\"32px\",\"left\":\"32px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"5px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-radius:5px;background-color:#bed8fa2e;padding-top:32px;padding-right:32px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:32px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">¿Qué hacemos?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">El tratamiento de la persona con Enfermedad de Parkinson requiere necesariamente de una perspectiva integral donde la familia o cuidadores estén involucrados. Para ello, se realiza una seria de actividades, en el que se explaya con más detalle.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/que-hacemos/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#bed8fa2e;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:64px;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:64px;padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"width\":\"320px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized has-custom-border\"><a href=\"https://es.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Camptocormia#/media/Archivo%3AAlexandre_Achille_Souques.jpg\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Alexandre_Achille_Souques.jpg/320px-Alexandre_Achille_Souques.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"border-radius:4px;width:320px;height:auto\" title=\"\"/></a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alexandre_Achille_Souques.jpg\">See page for author</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0\">CC BY 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">La Kinesia Paradojal</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Achile Alexandre Souqués, uno de los más afamados neurólogos franceses de principios del siglo veinte, describió una propiedad en el movimiento de las personas con EP a la que llamó kinesia paradojal (<em>kinesie paradoxale</em>). Por medio de esta propiedad los pacientes que él observaba súbitamente podían comenzar a moverse, incluso correr, aun presentando alteraciones severas para caminar. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/la-kinesia-paradojal/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer Más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">El Taller y la Comunidad</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Extensión Universitaria. Proyecto aprobado por la Universidad Nacional de La Plata (UNLP) para desarrollar en 2008.<br>Título: Calidad de Vida en el Taller de Parkinson. Una estrategia innovadora de establecimiento de relaciones productivas entre Universidad y Comunidad.<br>A fines del año 2007 la UNLP decidió aprobar y subsidiar nuestro proyecto presentado en el marco de la Convocatoria a Proyectos de Extensión Universitaria de esa institución. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/el-taller-y-la-comunidad/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer Más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1313,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/WhatsApp-Image-2022-10-15-at-20.04.45-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1313\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|ti-fg-alt\"}}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-inv\",\"textColor\":\"ti-fg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-fg-alt-color has-ti-bg-inv-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1314,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/facultad-medicina-1jpg.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1314\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">El Taller y la Universidad</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Desde 2016 incluimos a nuestro Programa estable como parte de extensión optativa de la Práctica Final Obligatoria (PFO) de los alumnos de la Carrera de Ciencias Médicas (FCM, UNLP).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Programa estable de la Facultad de Ciencias Médicas de la UNLP. Aprobado por Expte. Nº 800-15709/13 del 05/08/13 de la FCM UNLP.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/el-taller-y-la-universidad/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"},\"blockGap\":\"40px\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"5px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-radius:5px\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":728,\"width\":\"583px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/CC-Malvinas-Mes-concientizacion-Parkinson-2024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-728\" style=\"border-radius:4px;width:583px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"neve-fse\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Página de inicio', 'Muestra la página de inicio de tu sitio, tanto si está configurada para mostrar las últimas entradas como si es una página estática. La plantilla de la página de inicio tiene prioridad sobre todas las plantillas.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '15-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-06-25 00:00:02', '2025-06-25 00:00:02', '', 15, 'https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/?p=1356', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1357, 1, '2025-06-25 00:06:42', '2025-06-25 00:06:42', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"neve-fse\",\"tagName\":\"header\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"},\"blockGap\":\"0\",\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/themes/neve-fse/assets/img/neve-fse-img12.jpg\",\"dimRatio\":0,\"overlayColor\":\"ti-bg-inv\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":true,\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"minHeight\":344,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"contentPosition\":\"center center\",\"isDark\":false,\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1140px\",\"wideSize\":\"740px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull is-light\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:24px;min-height:344px\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/themes/neve-fse/assets/img/neve-fse-img12.jpg\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" data-object-position=\"50% 50%\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-ti-bg-inv-background-color has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"4rem\",\"bottom\":\"4rem\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-align-center\" style=\"margin-top:4rem;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4rem;margin-left:0\">Taller de Parkinson</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[metaslider id=\"95\"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"},\"blockGap\":\"64px\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>En ocasiones las personas con Enfermedad de Parkinson (EP) salen espontáneamente de la situación de inhibición motora en que se encuentran y esto es lo que conocemos como fenómeno paradojal. Y allí donde el movimiento era impensado, se suelta de sus ataduras como la mariposa de su capullo, transformándose y señalando un camino.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"},\"blockGap\":\"40px\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1308,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/historia.avif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1308\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"32px\",\"right\":\"32px\",\"bottom\":\"32px\",\"left\":\"32px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"0px\",\"topRight\":\"0px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"5px\",\"bottomRight\":\"5px\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:5px;border-bottom-right-radius:5px;background-color:#bed8fa2e;padding-top:32px;padding-right:32px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:32px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">Historia</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Nuestro Taller de Parkinson (TdP) fue creado en año 2002 como un espacio para propiciar transformaciones como la de la mariposa que, de oruga, pasa a ser una mariposa que sale de su capullo y vuela libremente en la naturaleza, su entorno de vida. &nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/historia/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1309,\"aspectRatio\":\"3/2\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border is-style-default\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/CC-Malvinas-Mes-concientizacion-Parkinson-2024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1309\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"32px\",\"right\":\"32px\",\"bottom\":\"32px\",\"left\":\"32px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"0px\",\"topRight\":\"0px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"5px\",\"bottomRight\":\"5px\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:5px;border-bottom-right-radius:5px;background-color:#bed8fa2e;padding-top:32px;padding-right:32px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:32px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">¿Quiénes somos?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">El Taller de Parkinson reúne a un grupo de voluntarios profesionales, estudiantes, personas con Parkinson y familiares con un mismo objetivo: mejorar la calidad de vida de las personas con EP y su entorno a través de acciones a un cambio conceptual y actitudinal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/quienes-somos/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1312,\"aspectRatio\":\"3/2\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border is-style-default\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/pppp.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1312\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"32px\",\"right\":\"32px\",\"bottom\":\"32px\",\"left\":\"32px\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"5px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-radius:5px;background-color:#bed8fa2e;padding-top:32px;padding-right:32px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:32px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">¿Qué hacemos?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">El tratamiento de la persona con Enfermedad de Parkinson requiere necesariamente de una perspectiva integral donde la familia o cuidadores estén involucrados. Para ello, se realiza una seria de actividades, en el que se explaya con más detalle.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/que-hacemos/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#bed8fa2e\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#bed8fa2e;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:64px;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:64px;padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"320px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Alexandre_Achille_Souques.jpg/320px-Alexandre_Achille_Souques.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"border-radius:4px;width:320px;height:auto\" title=\"\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alexandre_Achille_Souques.jpg\">See page for author</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0\">CC BY 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">La Kinesia Paradojal</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Achile Alexandre Souqués, uno de los más afamados neurólogos franceses de principios del siglo veinte, describió una propiedad en el movimiento de las personas con EP a la que llamó kinesia paradojal (<em>kinesie paradoxale</em>). Por medio de esta propiedad los pacientes que él observaba súbitamente podían comenzar a moverse, incluso correr, aun presentando alteraciones severas para caminar. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/la-kinesia-paradojal/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer Más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">El Taller y la Comunidad</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Extensión Universitaria. Proyecto aprobado por la Universidad Nacional de La Plata (UNLP) para desarrollar en 2008.<br>Título: Calidad de Vida en el Taller de Parkinson. Una estrategia innovadora de establecimiento de relaciones productivas entre Universidad y Comunidad.<br>A fines del año 2007 la UNLP decidió aprobar y subsidiar nuestro proyecto presentado en el marco de la Convocatoria a Proyectos de Extensión Universitaria de esa institución. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/el-taller-y-la-comunidad/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer Más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1313,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/WhatsApp-Image-2022-10-15-at-20.04.45-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1313\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|ti-fg-alt\"}}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-inv\",\"textColor\":\"ti-fg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-fg-alt-color has-ti-bg-inv-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1314,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/facultad-medicina-1jpg.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1314\" style=\"border-radius:4px;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">El Taller y la Universidad</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Desde 2016 incluimos a nuestro Programa estable como parte de extensión optativa de la Práctica Final Obligatoria (PFO) de los alumnos de la Carrera de Ciencias Médicas (FCM, UNLP).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Programa estable de la Facultad de Ciencias Médicas de la UNLP. Aprobado por Expte. Nº 800-15709/13 del 05/08/13 de la FCM UNLP.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/el-taller-y-la-universidad/\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">Leer más</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"64px\",\"bottom\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"},\"blockGap\":\"40px\"}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ti-bg-alt\",\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ti-bg-alt-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"5px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-radius:5px\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true},\"id\":728,\"width\":\"583px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"4px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/CC-Malvinas-Mes-concientizacion-Parkinson-2024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-728\" style=\"border-radius:4px;width:583px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"neve-fse\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Página de inicio', 'Muestra la página de inicio de tu sitio, tanto si está configurada para mostrar las últimas entradas como si es una página estática. La plantilla de la página de inicio tiene prioridad sobre todas las plantillas.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '15-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-06-25 00:06:42', '2025-06-25 00:06:42', '', 15, 'https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/?p=1357', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1358, 1, '2025-06-25 00:49:13', '2025-06-25 00:49:13', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>El Taller de Parkinson nació en abril de 2022 como iniciativa de un grupo de profesionales liderado por el Dr. José Luis Dillon, ex-Jefe del Servicio de Neurología del Hospital Dr. Alejandro Korn. El Taller funcionó en ese centro hospitalario hasta 2020 y desde 2022 funciona en el Centro de salud Teko Pora de la Asociación Civil Pantalón Cortito.<br>En el año 20076 comenzamos a trabajar mancomunadamente con la Universidad Nacional de La Plata (UNLP) a través de la Facultad de Ciencias Médicas (FCM) en el desarrollo de un proyecto de extensión y voluntariado universitario.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Desde ese momento nuestro Taller fue un espacio de formación para estudiantes de distintas carreras universitarias.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Desde 2009 a 2014 realizamos un convenio con la Fundación Horacio Corrada y tuvimos un sede de extensión en su Instituto Educativo CESALP.<br>En Asimismo, desde 2013 la FCM nos nombró somos pPrograma estable de extensión de la Facultad de Ciencias Médicas de la UNLP (aprobado por Expte. Nº 800-15709/13 del 05/08/13 de la FCM UNLP).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Desde 2016 brindamos la posibilidad de que los estudiantes puedan participar del Taller de Parkinson como parte de las horas de extensión a acreditar para la Carrera de Medicina, incluyendo la Práctica Final Obligatoria (PFO, FCM, UNLP).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A partir de 2020 comenzamos a trabajar con el Grupo de investigación y desarrollo aplicado a sistemas informáticos y computacionales (GIDAS, Universidad Tecnológica, Facultad Regional La Plata) en el proyecto TelePark, que continúa.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"62px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:62px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Los programas y proyectos que hemos desarrollado dentro de la UNLP son los siguientes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"23px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:23px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[pt_view id=\"ef5d1310pt\"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->', 'El Taller y la Universidad', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'el-taller-y-la-universidad', '', '', '2025-06-25 00:54:59', '2025-06-25 00:54:59', '', 0, 'https://tallerdeparkinson.com.ar/?page_id=1358', 0, 'page', '', 0),
